{"id":5608,"date":"2025-09-05T09:55:15","date_gmt":"2025-09-05T02:55:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5608"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:27:08","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:27:08","slug":"tai-khoan-tiktok-bi-han-che","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/tai-khoan-tiktok-bi-han-che\/","title":{"rendered":"T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf: Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"ANTEd6ATNoxLDlxFBIflL3uqgQc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMacdClzUoxVmVxZuzClpbw4gzg\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng r\u1ee7i ro l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p. Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c l\u00e0 k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng s\u1ed1ng c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng r\u1ee7i ro kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00e1ng c\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRcXdcl0vo8Qpwx9HublCn3Ogeg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SMCTdCnRmoD9yUxwY1clLvsngSE\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QS7PdKJo4oqGTrxbYg9lsGr8gnc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CaqmdQXwBoC45VxFD9BlCFztgmb\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9e83ab37-873d-4e3b-bf67-02179718e4d7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRAu9bXtIBoH6prx23ozl7wsOg2c%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RAu9bXtIBoH6prx23ozl7wsOg2c&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:412354,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5609\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5609\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5609\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi.png\" alt=\"T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 g\u00ec\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-la-gi-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5609\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 g\u00ec<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UiefdGUFyoWGuVxEF3QlrusGgFd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6XFdy3vMo2aEQx4R0rlSnZugCe\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a TikTok \u00e1p \u0111\u1eb7t c\u00e1c gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n l\u00ean m\u1ed9t ho\u1eb7c nhi\u1ec1u t\u00ednh n\u0103ng tr\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y x\u1ea3y ra khi thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u hi\u1ec7u vi ph\u1ea1m Ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n C\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ho\u1eb7c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. M\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m chung c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMojdtIxmo34bcx3IEOlYOW5gmN\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CzRFd5XJKoiOcbxHJIglmQfIgUg\">Ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn tr\u00ean TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqjtdGmY4ofiDlxdTS4lNEwsg6f\">T\u00f9y v\u00e0o m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 vi ph\u1ea1m, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-L5d7dfSNyopfTpxld6HlG4SHgsf\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B66sd6m31oBgZzxr7E4lWRRQgNd\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5610\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5610\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5610\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok.png\" alt=\"H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Tuong-tac-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5610\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HrIEdMOtioQT8jxIoDVltlkwgwf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OCnDdCqNNoTa9hxcMUUluRqigoe\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, th\u01b0\u1eddng x\u1ea3y ra khi b\u1ea1n b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, nh\u1eafn tin ho\u1eb7c theo d\u00f5i qu\u00e1 nhanh trong m\u1ed9t th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn. H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi ch\u1eb7n b\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u00e0y trong v\u00e0i gi\u1edd ho\u1eb7c 24 gi\u1edd \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ed1ng spam.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NHbodsUGiokiYrxGBeHlws9Rg5c\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf Nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Asqxd4B02oWAIUx5K9YljOZZgah\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Dg4Rd33qco6vkAxmTaVl5NGWgkd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3baf6e2b-8153-4f2d-97ba-2d110d7a8c68&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEV0xbrWk0oxQ4NxDUV7lTRh8gdc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EV0xbrWk0oxQ4NxDUV7lTRh8gdc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:110695,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5611\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5611\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5611\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok.png\" alt=\"H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf Nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-Nhan-thuong-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5611\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf Nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLEdd97HfoXPYVxgcmelZAhmgsb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEOhddgQgoA5Fdx5SxBls3elg7d\">H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n. T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng (kim c\u01b0\u01a1ng) trong c\u00e1c phi\u00ean livestream. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n th\u01b0\u1eddng do h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng nghi ng\u1edd c\u00f3 h\u00e0nh vi gian l\u1eadn \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ee5c l\u1ee3i t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EcYbdc7BRohf9Oxc2yFlOFe8gZb\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi v\u00e0 \u0110\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9 (kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mwtfdeu1Ao3O0wxaoUAlJ4Bwg3d\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-C05MdRwCToryjNxVW9TlIHIig4b\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fd4c1963-af03-4c62-a67d-fcc679deb553&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFYTfbFlgqoUS00xIuynljDjNgsb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FYTfbFlgqoUS00xIuynljDjNgsb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:60641,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5612\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5612\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5612\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok.png\" alt=\"H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi v\u00e0 \u0110\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9 (kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n) TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Han-che-tam-thoi-va-Dinh-chi-khoa-tai-khoan-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5612\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi v\u00e0 \u0110\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9 (kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n) TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUhVdDDjHoTuHlxf4EalGHWmgFc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ScM5d4z0noEBxrxk3cflIcnZgyh\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 x\u1eed l\u00fd n\u1eb7ng nh\u1ea5t. T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9 t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi trong v\u00e0i ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c v\u00e0i tu\u1ea7n n\u1ebfu vi ph\u1ea1m nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng. Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p vi ph\u1ea1m l\u1eb7p \u0111i l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c vi ph\u1ea1m c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9 v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n (kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n).<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AOzTd3IzVok2EZxxhVslRSKGgCh\">Top 5 nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn khi\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SG0wdScwPob7h0xAI8TlFn4CgGd\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><figure id=\"attachment_5613\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5613\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5613\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che.png\" alt=\"Top 5 nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn khi\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Top-5-nguyen-nhan-pho-bien-khien-tai-khoan-TikTok-bi-han-che-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5613\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Top 5 nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn khi\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PxX3d4Nc9oGP3YxCZiEl9zVBgah\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VaEYdoPQdoL3mOxWSbfld51egPd\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Vi ph\u1ea1m Ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n C\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3tWdLt9fo3UByxORdJlFxFzg7d\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t. C\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i c\u00f3 ch\u1ee9a y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 b\u1ea1o l\u1ef1c, ng\u00f4n t\u1eeb g\u00e2y th\u00f9 gh\u00e9t, th\u00f4ng tin sai l\u1ec7ch, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi nguy hi\u1ec3m s\u1ebd b\u1ecb h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng qu\u00e9t v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V267d1NfToHvqdxVbtbl5GKHgQf\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Reup video v\u00e0 vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n \u00e2m thanh, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GalhdDn7So2k4zxvttIlHcl2gEq\">Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i video c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 cho ph\u00e9p ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea1c, \u0111o\u1ea1n phim c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n l\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi vi ph\u1ea1m nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng. TikTok ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng th\u1eaft ch\u1eb7t vi\u1ec7c ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L8CCdWTbfoqLUpx67yulLZuBgee\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">\u0110i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng sang n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLmdARBgobDIcxPQbelnbQzg3b\">TikTok kh\u00f4ng khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch vi\u1ec7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng traffic ra b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch l\u1ed9 li\u1ec5u v\u00e0 ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c. Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean t\u1ee5c ch\u00e8n c\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng link website, YouTube, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c trong video v\u00e0 b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb xem l\u00e0 spam.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZE1sdLeEYoN5SRxJoXllM5nPg6b\" start=\"4\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">L\u1ea1m d\u1ee5ng spam trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KKrNd4o0Jo9Xxdx3pKPlzT37g0c\">H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u01b0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng bot ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, th\u1ea3 tim ho\u1eb7c m\u1eddi b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 nh\u1eb1m m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch gian l\u1eadn trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh nh\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a TikTok. Nh\u1eefng h\u00e0nh vi n\u00e0y s\u1ebd b\u1ecb x\u1eed l\u00fd r\u1ea5t n\u1eb7ng.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L3QsdElNhoERE5xHamclYHR0gie\" start=\"5\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">N\u1ed9i dung k\u00eanh thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ed9t ng\u1ed9t, b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A4wrd9qJDonEzixQ4Efl0vE0gOe\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, vi\u1ec7c m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh \u0111ang l\u00e0m v\u1ec1 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 A \u0111\u1ed9t ng\u1ed9t chuy\u1ec3n sang \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t video v\u1ec1 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 B kh\u00f4ng li\u00ean quan c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n nghi ng\u1edd. H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho r\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb hack ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb mua b\u00e1n, d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NnY3dPgwgo7aL0xtJBBl4asuguN\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Q8Y5dMT0loHBUzx9iTklJsIbgBc\">L\u1ea7m t\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn: B\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf do Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MVjZdnGg9omMW2x3LzIl8xqDg2g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RechdjiHyoSr4Uxj2KnleYjCgEX\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;97d0eb62-769c-4f36-8bc7-ce661982a59f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQqLsb348EoEVkExEgmBlLglRgub%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QqLsb348EoEVkExEgmBlLglRgub&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:401078,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5614\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5614\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5614\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok.png\" alt=\"L\u1ea7m t\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn: B\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf do Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lam-tuong-pho-bien-Bi-han-che-do-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5614\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u1ea7m t\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn: B\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf do Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf tr\u00ean TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GAl2daJMJo8AsRxPuIPlB2xQgJh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qa99dBW3Fo8uUmxDNwCl6YVrgUT\">Nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn gi\u1eefa vi\u1ec7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ecb TikTok ph\u1ea1t v\u00e0 vi\u1ec7c h\u1ecd \u0111ang v\u00f4 t\u00ecnh b\u1eadt &#8220;Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf&#8221;. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 hai kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n kh\u00e1c nhau. Vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u00fang v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 m\u00ecnh \u0111ang g\u1eb7p ph\u1ea3i.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-StcBdxzJLow8Mkx6htrl0Rfeg0e\">&#8220;Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf&#8221; l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kbjid8sJKoWa0jxRFPAleemugh8\">&#8220;Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf&#8221; l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00ednh n\u0103ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong>ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c t\u1eaft<\/strong> trong ph\u1ea7n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng. N\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch l\u1ecdc b\u1edbt c\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 tr\u01b0\u1edfng th\u00e0nh ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p, kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GoPpdJhDuoMvpOxnwBDlvhvZglg\">Khi b\u1eadt ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb ph\u1ea1t hay gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n t\u00ednh n\u0103ng, nh\u01b0ng trang &#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221; (FYP) c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u00edt video thu\u1ed9c c\u00e1c ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEtFdOL0zoVnlixy5u0lxAhQgBr\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1eefu \u00edch cho c\u00e1c b\u1eadc ph\u1ee5 huynh mu\u1ed1n t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng xem an to\u00e0n h\u01a1n cho con c\u00e1i, ho\u1eb7c cho nh\u1eefng ai \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n xem c\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng g\u00e2y kh\u00f3 ch\u1ecbu. C\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh l\u1ea1i, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc n\u1ed9i dung c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh ph\u1ea1t t\u1eeb TikTok.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CiGeducKromfDBxIh6Vl6R4bgld\">C\u00e1ch ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 t\u1eaft Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WcsWdUTaqoPngXxdGehld6dPgdg\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y trang &#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221; c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u00edt \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u01a1n b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 video m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 chia s\u1ebb, h\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra xem b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 \u0111ang b\u1eadt ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LSMpdBIuEoSKBzxWKknlhrGkguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o menu C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t:<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L3LNdrbnmoIv28xWBG1lFgT9gTg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-ZUHCd0NnioroFAxsPCdlikIeg9e\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a028dac6-21d4-42de-a916-18178d2a5d44&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGUGxb50K0o69EOxeC1plIyrrgYg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GUGxb50K0o69EOxeC1plIyrrgYg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:96303,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5615\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5615\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5615\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o menu C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t:\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Truy-cap-vao-menu-Cai-dat-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5615\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o menu C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t:<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrBTdqJMyo45RcxlHvOlRtdkghN\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpXddQQ1XoOC9kx0CCllcZWJghe\">\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn tab <strong>&#8220;H\u1ed3 s\u01a1&#8221;<\/strong> \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i. T\u1ea1i trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng <strong>ba d\u1ea5u g\u1ea1ch ngang<\/strong> \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1edf menu t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YOxndHpTGo73LCxSVkplsTPsgfe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: T\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee5c T\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u1ed9i dung:<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TGQWdvTHEoFvsKx1hl1lmMotghd\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5616\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5616\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5616\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: T\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee5c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u1ed9i dung\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Tim-den-muc-tuy-chon-noi-dung-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5616\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: T\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee5c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u1ed9i dung<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RIjZdbluxo2fCmxxZfFlpSg3g5g\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0047f4ca-c092-4b18-b453-39595ef95a0c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FY0i6bRrPnoBgLbxJ2wtluqphgad%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Y0i6bRrPnoBgLbxJ2wtluqphgad&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:86771,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUQHdrrGzo1MI9x7qJWl98aagje\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FEjLdpCDho5oiQxxeTRlwvHjgUf\">Trong menu v\u1eeba hi\u1ec7n ra, ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0&#8221;<\/strong>. Ti\u1ebfp theo, h\u00e3y k\u00e9o xu\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;T\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u1ed9i dung&#8221;<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HX33dLJp1oPE2oxZIs4l1eTvgIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1eaft Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf:<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z8HUdaVF8oGoEDx2ULFlWYW7gkf\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5617\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5617\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5617\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1eaft Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tat-Che-do-han-che-tren-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5617\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1eaft Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf tr\u00ean TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tv4ydIGHNoBmpHxsfyLl9KXrgle\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWQgdTI1YofeGgxE0FUlMVCagxf\">Trong m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u1ed9i dung&#8221;, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y d\u00f2ng ch\u1eef <strong>&#8220;Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf&#8221;<\/strong>. H\u00e3y nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt m\u00e3 4 ch\u1eef s\u1ed1 \u0111\u00e3 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3. Sau khi nh\u1eadp \u0111\u00fang m\u1eadt m\u00e3, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o n\u00fat <strong>&#8220;T\u1eaft&#8221;<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1ee1 b\u1ecf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AbFzdWzwpoUkuxxTjPJlDcbbg6b\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EyOGdi0CAoc6RaxXKPHllLkdglb\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00e1ng c\u00e1o khi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YhkKdJXNtoTzk5x5IXslR73QgCc\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n tin r\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GsNhdqLnboUMYJxWI7GlI0QYgmc\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o trong &#8220;H\u1ed9p th\u01b0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng&#8221;<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BiJRdT7Ago5LSLxyHJclEppRgvR\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RBuRdWkYnoNSzOxKwaKlLcG9gee\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f84f32f0-b813-4fcc-b17c-1530d8ff25b7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFIPQbR6mBo4snPxCTGGl6fH6gJh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FIPQbR6mBo4snPxCTGGl6fH6gJh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:765784,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5618\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5618\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5618\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o trong &quot;H\u1ed9p th\u01b0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng&quot;\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Kiem-tra-thong-bao-trong-Hop-thu-he-thong-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5618\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o trong &#8220;H\u1ed9p th\u01b0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng&#8221;<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYy4dX4KpoXhNgxXvNllNlDXg9c\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOljdkX9Voy7R9xMGM1lPnVWgYe\">\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c <strong>H\u1ed9p th\u01b0<\/strong> (Inbox) &gt; <strong>Th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng<\/strong>. TikTok th\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 vi ph\u1ea1m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch l\u00fd do v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AFPZdYHdmofigwxvJUXl4OiVgme\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: G\u1eedi khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QKAhdcMAxoPN56xVfdglCyt6gAb\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><figure id=\"attachment_5619\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5619\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5619\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: G\u1eedi khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Gui-khieu-nai-theo-huong-dan-tren-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5619\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: G\u1eedi khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn tr\u00ean TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Ss9tdLf5doWR0xxeSNtlx1bxg3f\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f71ee786-f2cf-4a29-a10d-133174c9ad59&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FExdnbRDfJoe7afxZCF3lwjreggf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ExdnbRDfJoe7afxZCF3lwjreggf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:180660,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M165dAyzaoRHkoxvj9Kla2hpgCe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABJldHr12oZsEixRpNClpm8Jgnf\">Trong th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o vi ph\u1ea1m \u0111\u00f3 th\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ebd c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t n\u00fat <strong>&#8220;Khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i&#8221; (Appeal)<\/strong>. H\u00e3y nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1, n\u00eau r\u00f5 l\u00fd do t\u1ea1i sao b\u1ea1n cho r\u1eb1ng h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TCZ1dyoLroC20CxczVJl4P3wgFb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a TikTok<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OSmvdqtuZofkeVxiBFdlGlBvgxb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5620\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5620\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5620\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Lien-he-bo-phan-ho-tro-cua-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5620\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ANTEd6ATNoxLDlxFBIflL3uqgQc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0hodcKsFoYrYwx6w3vlX37Fgrg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CbCPdw3mSo99mExI7EolANehgrc\">N\u1ebfu vi\u1ec7c khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp kh\u00f4ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng <strong>&#8220;B\u00e1o c\u00e1o V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1&#8221;<\/strong> trong ph\u1ea7n &#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0&#8221;. Tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 xem x\u00e9t l\u1ea1i tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TfpCdunPhoU1A3xnsGtlq73ig6g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-YyAVdkeDMotSMnxEevNlgruQg9c\">L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f2ng tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LPMmdDhBEoB384xPGtclpFHPg6c\">C\u00e1ch t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00f2ng tr\u00e1nh. H\u00e3y d\u00e0nh th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 Ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n C\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft nh\u1eefng n\u1ed9i dung n\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWpSdNQUhoMEh9xhKSjlr67FgHf\">H\u00e3y lu\u00f4n \u01b0u ti\u00ean vi\u1ec7c s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung g\u1ed1c. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n tr\u00e1nh c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, h\u00e3y t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 ch\u00e2n th\u00e0nh, tr\u00e1nh c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi spam l\u1eb7p \u0111i l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n lu\u00f4n c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn cao trong m\u1eaft h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UvgqdHGHBoZiYkxMMcblWXUpgFe\">B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y c\u1ee7a <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u00e3 cho b\u1ea1n bi\u1ebft vi\u1ec7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c vi ph\u1ea1m c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n m\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1eb7t ra. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u00e1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1o ra n\u1ed9i dung g\u1ed1c c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch v\u0103n minh, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m thi\u1ec3u t\u1ed1i \u0111a r\u1ee7i ro v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n an to\u00e0n, b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng may g\u1eb7p ph\u1ea3i h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, h\u00e3y b\u00ecnh t\u0129nh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00e1ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPrOdfvOzofgZQx8LwalUzrQgUd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VK7TdeFwKoPRSxxaOEPlv8NRgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1